Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:58.74,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.85,0:00:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜想我的声音早已没机会被你听见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'm losing hope that you can hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.84,0:00:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但机会永远存在 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's always that chance, isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.41,0:00:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那渺茫的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}That slim chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.11,0:00:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在而言 一切机会都是渺茫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all about slim chances now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.56,0:00:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着把每件事做对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to do everything right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.59,0:00:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保人们的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep people safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.59,0:00:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力了 摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried, Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.62,0:00:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.03,0:00:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的团体变得更小了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our group's smaller now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.57,0:00:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又失去了一员 就在前天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost another, day before last.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.42,0:00:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是她的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was her choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.23,0:00:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不能去责怪她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't say I blame her,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.31,0:00:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她失去了生存的信念\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she lost faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:01:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,疾控中心那是条死路\N{\fnArial\fs30}The C.D.C. was a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.77,0:01:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在那里遇见了一个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I met a man there,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.68,0:01:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}A scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.15,0:01:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对我说了一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.76,0:01:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对我说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.76,0:01:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那已经无关紧要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.83,0:01:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,重点是 我们要前进了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What matters is we're moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.16,0:01:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚特兰大这边沦陷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atlanta's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.42,0:01:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去本宁堡军事基地那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna try for fort benning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.98,0:01:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要面对一个漫长艰险的旅途\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're facing a long hard journey,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.75,0:01:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许比我想象中还要来的艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe even harder than I can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.38,0:01:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它并不会比我们至今经历的困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it can't be harder than our journey's been so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.27,0:01:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.32,0:01:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,125里路…\N{\fnArial\fs30}125 miles…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.27,0:01:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这么长的路要赶\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what lies ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.49,0:01:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着不丧失信念\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm trying hard not to lose faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.26,0:01:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不能丧失 否则 其他的人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. If I do, the others…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.05,0:01:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家庭 我的老婆…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family, my wife…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.53,0:01:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.78,0:02:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在剩下的人不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just a few of us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.01,0:02:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们要万众一心\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we've got to stick together,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.82,0:02:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,互相鼓励\N{\fnArial\fs30}fight for each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.02,0:02:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我们的性命互相托付\N{\fnArial\fs30}be willing to lay down our lives for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.13,0:02:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果情势所迫的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it comes to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,小伙儿 出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son, let's saddle up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.42,0:02:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们唯一的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only chance we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.64,0:02:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根 你在外边小心点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful out there, Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.00,0:02:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你和杜安父子平安\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you and Duane are okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.28,0:02:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,远离马路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay off the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.23,0:02:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.22,0:02:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼观六路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.01,0:02:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知该说啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, just…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.22,0:02:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之小心点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.50,0:02:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们能在本宁堡（乔治亚州西部城镇）再相会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we'll see you in Fort Benning someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.83,0:02:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick signing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.49,0:04:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚想起和卡尔去大峡谷的那次旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just thinking about our trip to the Grand Canyon with Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.13,0:04:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得这事儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.72,0:04:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你记不得 你那时只是个婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you wouldn't. You were just a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.32,0:04:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,况且 我们其实连沃斯堡（德州东北部城市）都还没到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, we never made it past Fort Worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.07,0:04:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真没 你那时病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you got sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.62,0:04:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不知道婴儿能吐得这么厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never knew a baby could throw up so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.80,0:04:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.89,0:04:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 很恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, ick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.92,0:04:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,德州的医生说你能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctor in Texas said you'd live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.83,0:04:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们就掉头回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we turned around and drove home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.69,0:04:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没劲儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.17,0:05:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那次旅行很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it was a good trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.07,0:05:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,最棒的一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.10,0:05:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能去看看吗 去大峡谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we go see it? The Grand Canyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.79,0:05:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.17,0:05:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.14,0:05:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.20,0:05:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,去的话一定会带上你和你妈妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd never go without you and your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.19,0:05:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.18,0:05:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来很复杂啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.22,0:05:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,诀窍在于 怎么拆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trick is getting all these pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.73,0:05:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就怎么装回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}back together the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.65,0:05:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能把你的也清洗一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could clean yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.25,0:05:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你示范一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}show you how.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是把好枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a sweet piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.44,0:05:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是份礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.86,0:05:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸送的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在我和艾米出门旅行前交给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave it to me just before amy and I took off on our road trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.93,0:06:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 两个姑娘出门在外\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said two girls on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.92,0:06:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,要能够保护自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}should be able to defend themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.68,0:06:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸是个聪明人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart man, your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.94,0:06:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看这枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's a…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.21,0:06:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这枪弹容有限\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a limited capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.68,0:06:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 只能装七发子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Only holds seven rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.66,0:06:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.76,0:06:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有路能过去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See a way through?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.52,0:06:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们该往回走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, maybe we should just go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.41,0:07:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那边有跨州的辅路 - 咱们油不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's an interstate bypass. - We can't spare the fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.29,0:07:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.24,0:07:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能从这儿过去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we get through here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.87,0:08:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就说过了 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said it. Didn't I say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.60,0:08:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了几千遍了 没水散热终究是不行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thousand times. Dead in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.35,0:08:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有问题吗 戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem, Dale?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.81,0:08:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 不过是被困在在荒郊野外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a small matter of being stuck in the middle of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有希望而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}with no hope of…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.99,0:08:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我说错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that was dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.22,0:08:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果在这儿都找不到软胶管的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can't find a radiator hose here…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.17,0:08:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里能找到一大堆东西呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a whole bunch of stuff we can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以用水管多抽出点燃料以便启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can siphon more fuel from these cars for a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.84,0:08:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许能还能找到水 - 或者食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe some water. - Or food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.42,0:08:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个坟场\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.79,0:08:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不知道自己作何感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how I feel about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.74,0:08:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了好了 开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.34,0:08:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家赶紧 看看周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, y'all. Just look around,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.44,0:08:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,收集能利用的一切东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}gather what you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.92,0:09:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们 别去看它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids, don't look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.43,0:09:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要哪个 - 平头螺丝刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which one? - The flathead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.39,0:09:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,散热片软管的夹片从来都用平头的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radiator hose clamp is always a flathead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.47,0:09:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,给 你来弄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.99,0:09:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,学点技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Learn something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.17,0:10:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德从不让我穿这样漂亮的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed never let me wear nice things like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.30,0:10:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会需要这些衣服的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.95,0:10:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.72,0:10:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别离开我的视线 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always within my sight, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.70,0:10:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是 索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too, Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.26,0:11:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切安好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.70,0:11:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.46,0:11:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.18,0:11:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们缺水吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were we short on water?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.83,0:12:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我留点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save me some!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.20,0:12:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这简直像在接受洗礼 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like being baptized, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.13,0:13:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.61,0:13:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉 躲到车底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori, under the cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 索菲亚 赶快趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, Sophia, get down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.68,0:13:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔和索菲亚 索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl and Sophia. Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.74,0:13:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘 到下面来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh shh. Get under.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.61,0:13:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.53,0:13:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,小声点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.54,0:20:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.34,0:20:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两个行尸在追我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's two walkers are after my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.40,0:21:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘 安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.72,0:21:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 没事吧 - 开枪打它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you all right? Are you okay? - Shoot them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.29,0:21:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.75,0:21:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些在马路上的行尸会听见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those walkers on the road would hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.18,0:21:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时就不止两个了 会有几百个过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it wouldn't be just two, it'd be hundreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.64,0:21:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,来我这 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.19,0:21:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 在这等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, just hold here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.64,0:21:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别动 等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay there. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.47,0:21:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.80,0:22:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,索菲亚 你要完全按照我说的去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophia, you have to do exactly as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.30,0:22:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲到那儿 越里面越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hide in there. Squeeze in tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.32,0:22:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去把它们引开 - 不不 别丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll draw them away from you. - No no, don't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.55,0:22:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen listen listen listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.18,0:22:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们不会气喘吁吁 而我会\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't get winded. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.59,0:22:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次我只能解决其中的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can only deal with them one at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.17,0:22:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我就没法保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be able to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.37,0:22:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这样我们才能都活下来 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how we both survive. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.93,0:22:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 去 去躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Go go go go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.65,0:22:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我没能回来 你就跑回公路去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't make it back, run back to the highway,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.38,0:22:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我们来的路直接跑回去找其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}back to the others straight the way we came.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.63,0:22:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证阳光落在你的左肩上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep the sun on your left shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.20,0:22:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.48,0:22:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些丑陋的狗崽子 来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ugly son of a bitch. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.75,0:22:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.66,0:22:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.76,0:22:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.26,0:23:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.55,0:24:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定是这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure this is the spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.83,0:24:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就将她留在这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left her right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.43,0:24:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将行尸们沿着小河向上游引走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drew the walkers way off in that direction up the creek.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.09,0:24:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有船桨使唤 估计也就是这地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without a paddle… seems where we've landed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.03,0:24:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来的时候她已经走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was gone by the time I got back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.42,0:24:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为她刚刚离开去找其他人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured she just took off and ran back to the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.35,0:24:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉她沿着那条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told her go that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.25,0:24:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且要保证阳光落在左肩上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and keep the sun on her left shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.28,0:24:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,小短腿 站那边去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, short round, why don't you step off to one side?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.20,0:24:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样会毁掉踪迹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're mucking up the trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.62,0:24:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望她分得清左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assuming she knows her left from her right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.21,0:24:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩 她明白我说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane, she understood me fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.57,0:24:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她又累又害怕 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid's tired and scared, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.19,0:24:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她刚刚从两个行尸身边死里逃生\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had her a close call with two walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.20,0:24:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的话有多少能起作用很值得怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to wonder how much of what you said stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.67,0:24:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有清晰的脚印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got clear prints right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.58,0:24:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她按你说的做了 向公路边走去\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did like you said, headed back to the highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.94,0:24:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分散开沿来路返回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's spread out, make our way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.62,0:24:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不可能走太远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She couldn't have gone far.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.81,0:24:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we gonna find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.51,0:24:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定是藏在某个灌树丛中\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be tuckered out hiding in a bush somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.25,0:25:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这之前她都没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was doing just fine till right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.12,0:25:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就一直走着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All she had to do was keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.56,0:25:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但从这里她就向那边偏离了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She veered off that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.43,0:25:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would she do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.24,0:25:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是看到什么东西 受到惊吓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she saw something that spooked her,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.39,0:25:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,被迫向那边跑去\N{\fnArial\fs30}made her run off.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.40,0:25:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,行尸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A walker?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.60,0:25:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,看不到其他脚印啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see any other footprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.25,0:25:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.07,0:25:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办 我们所有人再继续找下去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do we do? All of us press on?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.69,0:25:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 最好是你和格伦回到公路那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, better if you and Glenn get back up to the highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.88,0:25:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则其他人会惊慌失措的\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are gonna start panicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.94,0:25:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们我们正在尽力追踪她的踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them know we're on her trail doing everything we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.27,0:25:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是最重要的是 让大家保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}But most of all, keep everybody calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.97,0:25:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让他们继续在车辆之中搜寻宝物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll keep 'em busy scavenging cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.27,0:25:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,想些其他的事情 我会让他们保持忙碌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think up a few other chores. I'll keep 'em occupied.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.49,0:25:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.85,0:26:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么不一起出去找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't we all out there looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.29,0:26:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要把车子挪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we moving cars?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.49,0:26:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须清理出足够的空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to clear enough room so I can get the R.V.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.02,0:26:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样房车修好之后才能掉头\N{\fnArial\fs30}turned around as soon as it's running.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.86,0:26:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然有了燃料 我们可以原路返回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that we have fuel we can double back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.70,0:26:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,往格伦在地图上标记的那个支路上开\N{\fnArial\fs30}to a bypass that Glenn flagged on the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.03,0:26:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,比起清理这些破烂玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going back's going to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.84,0:26:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,原路返回要容易的多\N{\fnArial\fs30}easier than trying to get through this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.09,0:26:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我女儿回来之前 我们哪也不能去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going anywhere till my daughter gets back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.77,0:26:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还用说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that goes without saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.45,0:26:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克和达里尔已经去找了不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick and daryl, they're on it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.76,0:26:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只是时间问题 - 越快越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just a matter of time. - Can't be soon enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.07,0:26:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍然对路过我们的那群畜生心有余悸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still freaked out from that herd that passed us by,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.86,0:26:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不管你们叫它什么 - 那是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}- or whatever you'd call it. - Yeah, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.99,0:26:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,像游街一样走过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them just marching along like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.27,0:26:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,畜生 还真是那么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}A herd. That sounds about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.71,0:26:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前也遇到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.78,0:26:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟那晚帐篷遭到的攻击一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like the night camp got attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.96,0:26:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群行尸而已 没上次那么多罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some wadering pack, only fewer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.87,0:26:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.18,0:27:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,干活吧 我们还有很多事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, people. We still got a lot to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.27,0:27:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闲着 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's stay on it. Let's go, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.29,0:27:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,足迹消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracks are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.79,0:27:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 只是变模糊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they're faint,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.53,0:27:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,并没有消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they ain't gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.12,0:27:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来过这\N{\fnArial\fs30}She came through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.73,0:27:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.58,0:27:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了泥土和杂草我什么也看不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see anything. Dirt, grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.03,0:27:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我给你上堂追踪课\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a lesson in tracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.26,0:27:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是想赶紧找到那个女孩离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you want to find that girl and get our ass off that interstate?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.42,0:28:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 肖恩 - 卡尔 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shane. - Carl, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.06,0:28:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 我找到一个很酷的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mon, I found something cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.07,0:29:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩 你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.28,0:29:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个武器匣\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.83,0:29:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实很酷 送到戴尔那去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's cool, bud. Go give 'em to Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.95,0:29:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.01,0:29:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 是把斧头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, it's a hatchet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.98,0:29:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 别碰这些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}be careful. Don't play with those.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.52,0:29:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,真锋利啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're really sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.24,0:29:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没听见我说的话吗 - 我能留一个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did I just say? - Can I keep one?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.09,0:29:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你疯了吗 - 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you crazy? - No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.19,0:29:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩 肖恩 让她给我留一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane. Shane, tell her to let me keep one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.86,0:29:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,小兄弟 快送到戴尔那去 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, go give them all to dale now. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.99,0:29:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你那是什么态度 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was that? - What was what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.44,0:29:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚把他支走的口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way you blew him off just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.92,0:29:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让他很难堪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You crushed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.59,0:29:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信 你竟然对我这么冷淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe you. You're giving me the cold shoulder?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.88,0:29:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是正和你意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.31,0:29:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是让我滚远点吗 让我离你们远点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you the one who said stay the hell away from him and you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.16,0:29:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘记在疾控中心发生的事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forget what happened at the C.D.C.?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.78,0:30:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘记你在娱乐室干的蠢事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your little meltdown in the rec room slip your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.57,0:30:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你打算… - 我打算干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When you tried… - When I tried to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.12,0:30:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为我想干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think that was?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.65,0:30:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很清楚你当时想干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it is pretty plain what that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.94,0:30:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个错误 我承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mistake. One that I admit to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.79,0:30:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做过很多错事 洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a few mistakes under my belt, Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.25,0:30:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.03,0:30:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不否认\N{\fnArial\fs30}No debate there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.39,0:30:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是肖恩 我们不能再这样下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Shane, we need to stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.29,0:30:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你觉得我准备新车干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think I'm prepping my new ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.76,0:30:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.67,0:30:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.32,0:30:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in gone for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.49,0:30:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一找到机会就悄悄离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna quietly slip away first chance I get.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.24,0:30:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,「紧急预警系统已启动」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The emergency alert system has been activated."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.56,0:30:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,「民防办公室发布以下信息」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Office of Civil Defense has issued the following message:"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.69,0:30:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,「立即终止常规广播」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Normal broadcasting will cease immediately."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.40,0:30:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「现在是非常时刻」 - 这是当地信号吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "This is a civil emergency." - Is that a local signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.93,0:30:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号源肯定在50英里之内\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be within 50 miles of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.94,0:30:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,「不惜一切代价避免感染 保持镇定」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Avoid anyone infected at all costs. Remain calm."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.50,0:30:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,「救援马上就到」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Help is on the way."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.61,0:31:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,「紧急预警系统已启动」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The emergency alert system has been activated."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.43,0:31:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,「民防办公室…」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Office of Civil Defense…"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.13,0:31:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.61,0:31:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 继续干活吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.87,0:32:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophia!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.74,0:32:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.92,0:32:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,指甲里有皮肤残屑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skin under the fingernails.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.87,0:32:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,它刚用过餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It fed recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.62,0:32:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,牙缝里还有肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's flesh caught in its teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.65,0:32:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么肉啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what kind of flesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.87,0:32:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一种办法能够确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one way to know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.24,0:32:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.77,0:33:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这辈子开过几次膛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many kills you skin and gut in your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.46,0:33:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 我这把更锋利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, mine is sharper.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.83,0:33:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来就比较恶心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now comes the bad part.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.62,0:34:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来这王八蛋刚吃了顿大餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, hoss had a big meal not long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.63,0:34:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能摸到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel it in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.35,0:34:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 胃给你 - 我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- here's the gut bag. - I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.70,0:34:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这恶心的家伙午餐吃的是土拨鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}This gross bastard had himself a woodchuck for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.16,0:34:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少搞清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.61,0:34:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少搞清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.74,0:35:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,很晚了 天要黑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's late. Gonna be dark soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.16,0:35:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会找到她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.24,0:35:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手枪在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.50,0:35:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有权力拿走它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no right to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.16,0:35:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在也用不着 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need that just now, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.57,0:35:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是父亲给我的 它是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father gave it to me. It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.60,0:35:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先替你保管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hold onto it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.26,0:35:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是还给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you can give it back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.49,0:35:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.15,0:35:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我只想要回我的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I want my gun back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.88,0:35:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得那不是个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it's a good idea right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.78,0:35:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.82,0:35:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not comfortable with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.98,0:35:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth is,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.49,0:36:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,营地里的流动枪支越少越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}less guns we have floating around camp the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.44,0:36:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己的武器上交了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You turning over your weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.80,0:36:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.39,0:36:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我受过训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm trained in its use.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.46,0:36:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都需要接受枪支训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what the rest of y'all need is proper training.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.40,0:36:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But until that time I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.77,0:36:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得最好先让戴尔保管\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's best if Dale keeps them all accounted for.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.99,0:36:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind telling me what that's about?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.59,0:36:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 他们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh god, they're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.13,0:36:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没找到她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.63,0:36:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的足迹中途消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her trail went cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.77,0:36:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明天一早再去找\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll pick it up again at first light.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.47,0:36:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不能把我女儿丢在荒郊野岭\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't leave my daughter out there on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.91,0:36:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她独自在丛林里过夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}to spend the night alone in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.90,0:36:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,天黑了没法找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out in the dark's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.67,0:36:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,容易伤着自己人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd just be tripping over ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.24,0:36:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有更多人走失的\N{\fnArial\fs30}More people get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.32,0:36:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她只有十二岁 没法独自在外过夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she's 12. She can't be out there on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.68,0:36:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们什么都没找到吗 - 我知道你很难接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You didn't find anything? - I know this is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.80,0:36:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我希望你不要自乱阵脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm asking you not to panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.28,0:36:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道她就在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know she was out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.67,0:36:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找了很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we tracked her for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.64,0:36:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得有计划地追踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to make this an organized effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.08,0:36:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔对丛林最熟悉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl knows the woods better than anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.52,0:36:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把这件事交给他全权负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've asked him to oversee this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.99,0:37:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.20,0:37:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们击毙了一个行尸 - 有行尸 我的老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We took down a walker. - Walker? Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.07,0:37:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有碰到索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no sign it was ever anywhere near Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.91,0:37:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.82,0:37:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把那玩意剖开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cut the son of a bitch open,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.47,0:37:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经确认过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}made sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.32,0:37:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh god.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.05,0:37:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一开始就不应该把她丢在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you just leave her out there to begin with?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.11,0:37:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么可以离开她\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you just leave her?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.31,0:37:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两个行尸在追我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those two walkers were on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.76,0:37:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得引开它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to draw them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.00,0:37:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样她才最安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was her best chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.58,0:37:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的别无选择 卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like he didn't have a choice, Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.18,0:37:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要怎么才能自己找回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was she supposed to find her way back on her own?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.78,0:37:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还是个孩子 她还是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just a child. She's just a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.82,0:37:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我真的别无选择 我只能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my only option. The only choice I could make.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.28,0:37:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure nobody doubts that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.56,0:38:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的小宝贝一个人在丛林里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My little girl got left in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.34,0:38:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家每人拿一件武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody takes a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.81,0:38:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我们需要的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}These aren't the kind of weapons we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.07,0:38:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 枪呢 - 我们讨论过这个问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about the guns? - We've been over that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.98,0:38:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 达里尔和瑞克拿枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, Rick and I are carrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.86,0:38:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,防止某人一听到风吹草动就狂放子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't have people popping off rounds every time a tree rustles.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.71,0:38:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,风吹草动可吓不倒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the trees I'm worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.89,0:38:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如有人在不恰当的时机开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say somebody fires at the wrong moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.60,0:38:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那群畜生又恰巧经过\N{\fnArial\fs30}a herd happens to be passing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.83,0:38:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就全部玩儿完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, then it's game over for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.17,0:39:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就别想着拿枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you need to get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.22,0:39:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的计划是沿河而上走五英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The idea is to take the creek up about five miles,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.50,0:39:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后掉头从河对岸再找回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}turn around and come back down the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.62,0:39:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很可能就在河边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chances are she'll be by the creek.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.92,0:39:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是她唯一熟悉的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's her only landmark.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.28,0:39:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持安静 提高警觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay quiet and stay sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.91,0:39:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼此保持距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep space between you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.97,0:39:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不要离开大家的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}but always stay within sight of each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.60,0:39:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家收拾东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody assemble your packs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.07,0:39:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.98,0:39:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你继续修车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep on those repairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.94,0:39:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得让这辆房车随时待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to get this R.V. ready to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.88,0:39:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可不会无故在这多待一分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't stay here a minute longer than we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.00,0:39:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.96,0:39:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,把索菲亚找回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring Sophia back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.86,0:39:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我们照顾一下卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep an eye on Carl while we're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.18,0:39:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和你们一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.50,0:39:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们需要人手 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need people, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.56,0:39:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才能搜寻更多的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}To cover as much ground as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.01,0:39:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你决定吧 坏人不能总让我当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your call. I can't always be the bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.49,0:39:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都能照看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he has all of you to look after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.09,0:39:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该会很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say he's in good hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.27,0:39:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.55,0:39:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟大家一样 千万不要脱离我们的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}But always within our sight, no exceptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.82,0:40:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德莉亚 我求你了 不要逼我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea, I'm begging you. Don't put me in this position.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.99,0:40:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿不到枪 我是不会去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going out there without my gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.63,0:40:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll even say please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.92,0:40:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这么做是为了你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.34,0:40:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 戴尔 你是为了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dale, you're doing it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.15,0:40:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再这样了 你觉得我会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to stop. What do you think's gonna happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.25,0:40:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一把枪还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna stick it in my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.23,0:40:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会把它伸进嘴里 饮弹自尽吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and pull the trigger the moment you hand it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.16,0:40:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在生我的气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're angry at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.87,0:40:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白你的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That much is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.72,0:40:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果我当时不那么做的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I hadn't done what I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.26,0:40:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd be dead now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.14,0:40:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹纳给了我们选择的机会 我选择留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenner gave us an option. I chose to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.84,0:40:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选择自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.56,0:40:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那跟你有什么关系 你根本就不了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's that to you? You barely know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.83,0:40:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道艾米的死让你伤心欲绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know Amy's death devastated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.37,0:40:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别扯上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep her out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.94,0:40:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这跟艾米没关系 这是我们之间的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not about Amy. This is about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.34,0:40:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我觉得没有活下去的意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I decided that I had nothing left to live for,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.89,0:40:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈有什么资格阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}who the hell are you to tell me otherwise?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.27,0:40:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼着我放弃自己的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}To force my hand like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.67,0:40:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我救了你 - 不 戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I saved your life. - No, Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.71,0:40:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我救了你 是你逼我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved yours. You forced that on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.50,0:40:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让你为了我而送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want your blood on my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.97,0:41:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我离开那座大楼的唯一理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that is the only reason I left that building.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.30,0:41:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为会怎样 你以为我会幡然顿悟\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you expect? What, I'd have some kind of epiphany?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.26,0:41:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要坚定地活下去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some life-affirming catharsis?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.81,0:41:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许会心存感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe just a little gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.24,0:41:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.30,0:41:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想在爆炸中死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to die my way,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.80,0:41:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是被那些流着口水的怪物撕碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}not torn apart by drooling freaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.49,0:41:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是我的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.62,0:41:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你剥夺了我选择的权利 戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took that away from me, Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.05,0:41:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是… - 你觉得很了解我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But… - But you know better?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.78,0:41:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从我妹妹死了之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I wanted after my sister died was to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.18,0:41:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一心只想从这无尽的噩梦中解脱出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}of this endless horrific nightmare we live every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.52,0:41:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有伤害到其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't hurting anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.15,0:41:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你剥夺了我选择的权利 戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took my choice away, Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.42,0:41:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还期待我态度好点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you expect gratitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.45,0:41:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道要说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.70,0:41:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not your little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.05,0:41:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你老婆 肯定也不是你的负担\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not your wife. And I am sure as hell not your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.05,0:41:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我要说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all there is to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.67,0:42:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙恩 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.43,0:42:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸说我可以拿着它 老妈说只要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad said I could carry it and mom said as long as I was…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.87,0:42:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,小点声 我们在找索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it down. We're looking for sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.65,0:42:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意力放在找人上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to focus on the task.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.31,0:42:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟上 - 跟着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got to keep up. - I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.42,0:42:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事吧 - 我觉得沙恩讨厌我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - I think shane's mad at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.65,0:42:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我做错事了吗 - 没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did I do something wrong? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.91,0:43:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的没有 宝贝 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, honey, I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.95,0:43:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是 只是担心索菲亚 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just… he's worried about Sophia, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.82,0:43:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 她可能在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. She could be in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.19,0:43:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面也可能有其他东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be a whole bunch of things in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.44,0:44:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.78,0:44:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻声叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call out softly.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.38,0:44:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她在里面 让她第一个听到你的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she's in there, yours is the first voice she should hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.60,0:44:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,索菲亚 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophia, sweetie,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.98,0:44:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在里面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.97,0:44:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,索菲亚 我是妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophia, it's mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.26,0:44:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,索菲亚 我们都在这儿 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophia. We're all here, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.24,0:44:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.45,0:45:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.55,0:45:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.57,0:45:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.89,0:45:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁在里面 - 无名氏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's in there? - Some guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.01,0:45:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,像詹纳说的那样 选择退出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did what Jenner said. Opted out.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.86,0:45:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是这么说的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't that what he called it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.99,0:45:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}What direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.56,0:45:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是那边 我肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that way. I'm pretty sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.53,0:45:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 在这里很难辨别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, it's hard to tell out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.13,0:45:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都听到了 索菲亚肯定也听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we heard them, maybe sophia did too.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.02,0:45:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在敲钟 也许是在召集什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's ringing those bells, maybe calling others.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.26,0:46:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是表明他们已经找到了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or signaling they found her.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.54,0:46:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是她自己敲的 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could be ringing them herself. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.21,0:46:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不去修引擎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't you supposed to be fixing that radiator?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.38,0:46:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他们带着索菲亚回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they come back with Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.60,0:46:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克想继续前进怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Rick wants to move on right away?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.32,0:46:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 昨天我就修好了 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I had it fixed yesterday. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.09,0:46:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又磨又搓是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was all that rubbing and sanding for then?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.92,0:46:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你胡说的吗 - 可以这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's just bullshit? - Yeah, that's one word.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.19,0:46:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可以说是演哑剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another word would be pantomime…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.65,0:46:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是为了现一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just for show.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.85,0:46:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one else needs to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.71,0:46:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哑剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pantomime.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.11,0:46:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是其他人知道车修好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the others know we're mobile,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.73,0:46:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们又会组织起来继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll want to mobilize and move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.87,0:46:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你觉得他们找不到索菲亚 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you don't think they're gonna find sophia, that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.59,0:46:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是做最坏的打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just guarding against the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.96,0:46:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,早晚 要是找不到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sooner or later, if she's not found,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.74,0:46:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家又会算来算去\N{\fnArial\fs30}People will start doing math.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.84,0:46:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想避开那些过多的争锋相对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to hold off the needs-of-the-many-
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.15,0:46:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一些争吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}versus-the-needs-of-the-few arguments.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.65,0:46:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,越远越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}as long as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.85,0:47:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,明哲保身嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is one tricky hose, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.87,0:47:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.25,0:47:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对劲 没有尖塔也没有钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That can't be it. Got no steeple, no bells.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.84,0:47:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.30,0:48:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophia!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.34,0:48:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶稣 你在聆ste听祷告吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, J.C., you taking requests?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.73,0:48:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 不是这座教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, it's the wrong church.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.14,0:48:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,它没有尖塔 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got no steeple, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.43,0:48:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿没有尖塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no steeple.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.23,0:49:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个电子钟 定时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A timer. It's on a timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.19,0:49:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要进去待会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go back in for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.14,0:49:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的要离开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you really leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.70,0:49:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得这对大家都好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think it's best for all of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.43,0:49:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 什么使你做的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it is. What made you decide?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.53,0:49:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打退堂鼓了 只想在这里做个好人 洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta back away. Just trying to be the good guy here, Lori,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.66,0:49:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使你无法理解 这不是刻意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if you don't see it. None of this was intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.76,0:50:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.81,0:50:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,无关紧要了 我都已经说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't matter. As long as I said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.55,0:50:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这么凭空消失 你连瑞克都不告诉一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just gonna disappear? You're not even gonna tell Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.33,0:50:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只会试着阻止我 这正合你意\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd only try to stop me. That's on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.73,0:50:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉他你想怎么样 要么啥也别说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell him what you want. Or tell him nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.28,0:50:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.08,0:50:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那卡尔呢 我们把他牵扯进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Carl? We dragged him into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.47,0:50:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱卡尔 - 他觉得你讨厌他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love Carl. - He thinks you hate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.09,0:50:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在试着保持点距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to put some distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.02,0:50:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让事情变得容易点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to make this easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.14,0:50:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,可这样对我们谁都不容易 尤其是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't easy on any of us, least of all me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.63,0:50:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是失去你的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one who loses you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.57,0:50:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,神父 原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.85,0:51:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不配得到您的怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't deserve your mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.92,0:51:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾祈祷安全离开亚特兰大而您应允了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prayed for safe passage from Atlanta and you provided.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.81,0:51:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾祈祷爱德会因为打我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prayed for Ed to be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.92,0:51:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为用他内心深处萌生的邪恶想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}for laying his hands on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.85,0:51:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他的亲生女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and for looking at his own daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.99,0:51:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,而受到惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}with whatever sickness was growing in his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.83,0:51:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祈祷您能阻止那一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prayed you'd put a stop to it,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.55,0:51:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我有机会好好地抚养她\N{\fnArial\fs30}give me a chance to raise her right,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.33,0:51:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助她不要重蹈我的覆辙\N{\fnArial\fs30}help her not make my mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.32,0:51:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她害怕极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's so fearful.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.97,0:51:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还太小了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's so young in her way.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.97,0:51:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还有很多路要走\N{\fnArial\fs30}She hasn't had a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.02,0:51:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,祈祷爱德死是我罪恶深重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praying for Ed's death was a sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.47,0:51:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 不要让我受到如此的惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't let this be my punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.37,0:51:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,护她平安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her be safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.92,0:52:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,平安的活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}alive and safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.94,0:52:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.23,0:52:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我任由你惩治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punish me however you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.52,0:52:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是请保佑她\N{\fnArial\fs30}but show mercy on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.36,0:52:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和你一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.83,0:52:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你到底在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what the hell you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.50,0:52:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是傻子 我也没聋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not stupid and I'm certainly not deaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.92,0:52:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道有什么故事 - 没有故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, I don't know the story. - There is no story.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.40,0:52:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 我不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.26,0:52:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拿忽悠别人那招来应付我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't confuse me with someone who does.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.75,0:52:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在只关心如何离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, all I care about is getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.93,0:52:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,走得越远越好 和你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far away as I can, like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.58,0:52:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们一起在夕阳下远航吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna sail off into the sunset together?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.46,0:52:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,手牵着手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gonna hold hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.79,0:52:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是想和你在一起 沙恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking you to go steady, Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.79,0:52:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你把我带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking for a ride,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.10,0:52:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个另寻他处重新开始的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}A chance to start over somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.84,0:52:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最近观察过这个队伍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You observe this group lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.50,0:53:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有 我发现两个人不属于这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have. I see two people who don't belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.15,0:53:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the odd men out.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.46,0:53:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把彼此隔的太远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between the two of us, we make a great third wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.44,0:53:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使这样又如何 逃走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what? Say we do, we just run off.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.69,0:53:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又凭什么要帮你这个累赘呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in it for me except for the extra ass I got to cover?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.23,0:53:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有机会为别人做点事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chance to do something for someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.99,0:53:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 换位思考一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - And a door that swings both ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.20,0:53:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我把枪 我也会保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put a gun in my hand, I'll cover your ass too.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.28,0:53:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好想想吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.63,0:53:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to move here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.33,0:53:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这帮人累坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people are spent.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.77,0:53:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有几个小时就要天黑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only so many hours of daylight left.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.68,0:53:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回去的路还很长 - 我不能停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We still got a long way back. - I can't stop yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.97,0:53:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有很多地方没找\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still got a lot of ground to cover,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.52,0:53:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括整条小溪的对岸\N{\fnArial\fs30}whole other side of the creek bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.84,0:53:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以在回去的路上找\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we search that on the way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.02,0:53:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也许会听到钟声\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would have heard those church bells.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.65,0:53:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许就在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could be nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.63,0:53:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可能的事情太多了 - 我不能回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She could be a lot of things. - I can't go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.70,0:53:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被落到这里是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her being out here is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.76,0:53:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.98,0:53:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们让你怀疑自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they got you doubting yourself, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.93,0:54:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 你怀疑我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you? You doubt me?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.61,0:54:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们每个人都犯过错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we can assign all kinds of blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.45,0:54:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到她对我们意义重大\N{\fnArial\fs30}This means something, finding her.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.64,0:54:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh man.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.61,0:54:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要奇迹发生 决不能放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be the miracle we need. We can't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.55,0:54:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们顺着河边往回找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all gonna follow the creek bed back,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.14,0:54:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔 你带队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Daryl, you're in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.72,0:54:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和瑞克负责断后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Rick, we're just gonna hang back,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.41,0:54:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行一个小时左右的搜索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Search this area another hour or so just to be thorough.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.86,0:54:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我们就分开了 确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're splitting us up. You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.88,0:54:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定 我们会赶上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'll catch up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.24,0:54:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to stay too.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.34,0:54:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是她的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm her friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.64,0:54:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多加小心 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just be careful, okay? - I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.40,0:54:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候长大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you start growing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.52,0:54:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很快就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be along soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.67,0:55:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.71,0:55:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得怎么用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember how to use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.75,0:55:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会拿走你的枪 让你赤手空拳的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not taking your gun and leaving you unarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.16,0:55:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有一把 拿着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, got a spare. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.53,0:55:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等我一会儿 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me a minute? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.63,0:55:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.29,0:55:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白你这个眼神是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if you're looking at me with what?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.00,0:55:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,悲伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadness?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.36,0:55:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻蔑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scorn?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.69,0:55:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.54,0:56:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是爱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.16,0:56:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许只是漠不关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's just indifference.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.56,0:56:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你已经知道我不是什么虔诚的信徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you already know I'm not much of a believer.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.66,0:56:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是把信念放在别的地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I just chose to put my faith elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.86,0:56:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分放在家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family, mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.24,0:56:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.43,0:56:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,和工作上\N{\fnArial\fs30}My job.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.11,0:56:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is, we…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.21,0:56:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要点东西帮我们前行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could use a little something to help keep us going.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.84,0:56:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.72,0:56:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Acknowledgement.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.40,0:56:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些我做的事是正确的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some indication I'm doing the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.85,0:56:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道有多难\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know how hard that is to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.88,0:57:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.06,0:57:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不需要所有的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey look, I don't need all the answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.41,0:57:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,只想要一点动力 一个暗示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a little nudge. A sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.38,0:57:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么暗示都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any sign will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.50,0:57:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 得到你想要的了？-我想我会自己找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get what you needed? - guess I'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.25,0:58:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就完了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.07,0:58:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是整个计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This the whole plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.61,0:58:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这计划是要把队伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess the plan is to whittle us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.03,0:58:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,消减的越来越小吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into smaller and smaller groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.61,0:58:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,随身携带刀和尖木棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carrying knives and pointy sticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.86,0:58:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你的枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you have a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.55,0:58:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你想要这枪么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, you want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.77,0:58:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 拿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.22,0:58:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够你看我的眼神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sick of the looks you're giving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.66,0:58:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所有人的眼神\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.56,0:58:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我不能想像出你正经历的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, I can't imagine what you're going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.03,0:58:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我愿意做任何事去平复它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I would do anything to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.58,0:58:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你必须停止责怪瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have got to stop blaming Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.63,0:58:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次你看他时都表露出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is in your face every time you look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.54,0:58:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,索菲亚跑走时他没有犹豫 对么\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Sophia ran he didn't hesitate, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.45,0:58:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一秒都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.45,0:58:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know that any of.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.67,0:58:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能像他那样追着她去\N{\fnArial\fs30}us would have gone after her the way he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.74,0:58:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是像他做那么艰难的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or made the hard decisions that he had to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.81,0:58:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能做的不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or that anybody could have done it any differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.71,0:58:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.57,0:59:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们依靠他还责怪他的不完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all look to him and then you blame him when he's not perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.46,0:59:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们认为没有他也照走 恕不挽留\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you think you can do this without him, go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.49,0:59:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人拦着你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody is stopping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.78,0:59:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该继续走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should keep moving.
